$ gragas attention --help
--- stdout

  Lists the rules that need you, grouped
  by what is missing: a
  review-by that is past, no source, no
  example pair, no decision
  where the governance asks for one, no
  owner. The days are judged
  against today's date, read when the
  command runs; nothing is
  kept between runs. A retired rule asks
  for nothing. When every
  rule is proposed it lists the whole
  book, and says so first.
  It reads and changes nothing.

    gragas attention
    gragas attention --json

  USAGE


    gragas attention [--flags]


  FLAGS

    --accessible  Plain questions
                  (ACCESSIBLE)
    --config      The settings file
                  (GRAGAS_CONFIG)
    -h --help     Help for attention
    --json        Answer in one JSON
                  document
    --no-color    No colour (NO_COLOR)
    --plain       Print plainly: nothing
                  moves

--- stderr
